Package: cfbstats
Title: Forecast College Football Players' Paths to the NFL Draft
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("First", "Last", , "first.last@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools and data pipelines for studying what shapes a college
    football player's path to the NFL draft, and how well draft outcomes can
    be forecast from information available during a player's career. Builds on
    the College Football Data (CFBD) API and pursues both explanatory and
    predictive modeling.
